---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How PharmaXports collects, uses and protects information submitted through this website." noindex={false}>
  <div class="container-page pt-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  </div>
  <article class="container-page py-12 max-w-3xl prose-body">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl text-[color:var(--color-navy)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit an enquiry, request a quote, or add products to an inquiry list, we collect the information you provide directly: name, company name, business email, phone number, country, and the details of your product or bulk requirement. Where you upload a product list or RFQ document, we collect that file.</p>

    <h2>How We Use It</h2>
    <p>We use this information solely to respond to your enquiry, prepare quotations, coordinate documentation with manufacturing partners, and maintain a record of the B2B relationship. We do not sell your information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>Inquiry List (Local Storage)</h2>
    <p>Products you add to your inquiry list are stored locally in your browser, not on our servers, until you submit the inquiry form. Clearing your browser data will clear this list.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain enquiry and quotation records for as long as reasonably necessary to service the business relationship and meet applicable legal and export documentation requirements.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of the information you've submitted by contacting us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use standard web analytics tools to understand aggregate site usage (page views, product searches, form completions). This does not identify you personally beyond what you voluntarily submit through a form.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
